---
description: Assemble a tender response from ordered obligations, verified capabilities, reconciled contributions and a hash-bound bundle validation artifact.
args:{request:BidPreparationRequest;room:TenderSourceRoom;prior?:TenderCheckpoint|null}
returns:TenderProgramResult
---
Bind saved = prior when supplied, otherwise null. Bind addendumImpact = `assessAddendumImpact(request, room.addenda, room.responses)` before deriving requirements. If addendum order or deadline effect is unresolved, keep earlier drafts stale. Bind goal = `frameTender(request, room.responses)` and policy = `selectTenderPolicy(room.policyCandidates, request.tenderId)` for the exact issue, authority, response owner and channel.

Bind obligations = `parseTenderObligations(goal, policy, room.responses, room.evidencePages, room.addenda)`. Separate eligibility, scored preference, conditional instruction, form, naming and attachment requirements. Every requirement needs a response slot or explicit nonresponse choice. Bind capabilities = `matchVerifiedCapabilities(goal, policy, obligations, room.evidencePages)`; match only exact product edition, scope and evidence. Unsupported mandatory capabilities block response drafting. Bind contributions = `commissionRequirementEvidence(goal, policy, capabilities, room.evidencePages)`, assigning each gap to a responsible team, acceptable evidence and deadline.

Bind quantities = `reconcileQuantitySchedule(request, room.pricingSchedules)` and certificate = `confirmCertificateWindow(request, room.certificates)` before any promise. Conflicting quantity assumptions block affected price and delivery claims. A certificate expiring before performance requires a dated approved renewal commitment. Bind sections = `writeEvidenceBoundResponse(goal, policy, obligations, capabilities, contributions, room.evidencePages)`. Keep commercial and technical claims consistent and label approved future commitments explicitly.

Only when every mandatory gap has an accountable resolution and no unsupported claim remains, select one `PortalBundleValidation` from room.bundleValidations matching tender, response hash and ordered addendum revision. Bind portalLimits = `checkPortalLimits(request, room.bundleConstraints, sections, room.bundleValidations)`; accept only the exact validation artifact's pass result and complete forms. Bind bundle = `freezeTenderBundlePreview(request, goal, obligations, sections, portalLimits, addendumImpact, quantities, certificate)`. Approval must bind its exact response and file-set hashes. If a portal timeout is present, bind timeout = `recoverPortalTimeout(request, room.portalReceipts)` and retry only when authoritative status proves no accepted submission; an unknown status stays unknown. Bind checkpoint = reconcileTenderCheckpoint(saved, request, room, obligations, sections, bundle, timeout). Retain ordered addendum revisions, exact response and file hashes, approvals and portal acknowledgments. New addenda stale only affected sections; an unknown portal outcome stays bound to that exact submission hash and requires readback before retry. Return { caseId: request.caseId, goal, policy, obligations, capabilities, contributions, response: sections, bundle, guardrails: [addendumImpact, quantities, certificate, portalLimits, timeout], unresolved, checkpoint, commitAllowed: false } as TenderProgramResult. No upload or portal acknowledgment is claimed here.